 * Wrangler's build admission verifies every cached byte with the producer verifier.
 * Each operation checks the live producer at one immutable commit before using that
 * compiled evaluator. A semantic release change requires admission and deployment;
 * an unrelated producer commit does not. No raw-contract interpreter or local form.
 */
